# ============================================================
# MASLD — WHITELIST policy: track CODE + CONFIG only.
# Default-deny everything, re-include code/config types,
# then hard-exclude heavy / vendored / output / ephemeral trees.
# ============================================================

# 1) Ignore everything by default
*

# 2) Let git descend into directories
!*/

# 3) Re-include analysis code (anywhere)
!*.R
!*.r
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.sbatch
!*.smk
!Snakefile
!Makefile
!*.pl
!*.cpp

# 4) Re-include web-portal source
!*.ts
!*.tsx
!*.js
!*.jsx
!*.mjs
!*.cjs
!*.css
!*.scss

# 5) Re-include configs
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.toml
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!requirements.txt
!environment.yml

# Curated figure configuration (small, hand-maintained source table)
!scripts/figures/fig5a_therapeutic_axes.tsv
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/config/*.tsv

# Genetics-context v2 uses small, hand-maintained source contracts and test
# fixtures; keep these auditable while candidate result tables remain ignored.
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/genetics_context_v2/README.md
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/genetics_context_v2/config/*.tsv
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/genetics_context_v2/tests/fixtures/*.csv
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/candidates/program-context-v2-candidate-2026-08-07/genetics_context/logs/.gitkeep

# Myojin Plan-40 firewall keeps only its hand-maintained contracts and
# synthetic fixtures in git; authenticated source and candidate tables remain
# ignored under the default-deny policy.
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/myojin_hlf/README.md
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/myojin_hlf/OUTPUT_CONTRACT.md
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/myojin_hlf/tests/README.md
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/myojin_hlf/tests/fixtures/*.csv
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/candidates/program-context-v2-candidate-2026-08-07/myojin_hlf/logs/.gitkeep
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/candidates/program-context-v2-candidate-2026-08-07/myojin_hlf/work/.gitkeep

# Plan 43 keeps its small, outcome-blind source registry and promotion contract
# auditable in git. Public source payloads and candidate results remain ignored.
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/chronic_state_risk_bridge/README.md
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/chronic_state_risk_bridge/config/*.tsv

# Spatial Resource v2 keeps its manifest-driven source contract and routing
# documentation auditable; immutable candidate outputs remain ignored.
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/spatial_context_v2/README.md
!Analysis/Multimodal_Program_Projection/scripts/spatial_context_v2/spatial_resource_datasets.tsv

# 6) Re-include named config JSON / manifests only (NOT all *.json — results are json)
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig*.json
!*.config.json
!next.config.*
!tailwind.config.*
!postcss.config.*
!components.json
!.eslintrc*

# 7) Hard-exclude top-level trees we never want (vendored / data / output / ephemeral)
/data/
/tools/
/SteatoSite/
/Liver_Atlas/
/archive/
/figures/
/figures_STAR_s0/
/figures_kallisto/
/logs/
/outputs/
/agent_status/
/comprehensive_analysis/
/zenodo_deposit/
/team_B_code/
/scratch/
/memory/
/omnipathr-log/
/NMF_*/
/results/
/.claude/
/.superpowers/
/.agent/
/.firecrawl/
/.review/
/.envs/

# 7a) Docs are entirely private and ignored.
/docs/

# 7c) Cas13 library design is a separate line of work (active owner: vpassanisi)
#     and is not versioned by this repository. Its files remain on disk; they
#     were untracked here via `git rm -r --cached Cas13_Library_Design`.
/Cas13_Library_Design/

# 7b) Hard-exclude language/package environments & caches ANYWHERE
#     (these contain thousands of library .py/.R/.sh files the whitelist would grab)
**/.mamba/
**/.conda/
**/conda-meta/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/site-packages/
**/__pycache__/
**/.snakemake/
**/.Rlib*/
**/renv/library/
**/*_work/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
micromamba

# 8) Hard-exclude output / generated / vendored subtrees ANYWHERE
**/archive/
**/results/
**/results_gpu_v2*/
**/counts/
**/alignment/
**/fragments/
**/spaceranger/
**/cellranger/
**/cnmf_runs/
**/qc/
**/multiqc/
**/fastqc/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/
**/coverage/
**/public/data/
# Downloaded external source material (papers, Zenodo payloads, cloned repos).
# An embedded git clone here was accidentally staged as a bare gitlink 2026-08-10.
**/work/public_sources/

# 9) Stray junk
/scratch.R
/Rplots.pdf

# 10) Secrets / credentials — never track (defense in depth)
**/.cibersortx_creds
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.token
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.streamlit/secrets.toml
